{"sentence_id": "hb-c12-u0234-s001", "text": "Om du behöver visum eller uppehållstillstånd för att vistas i Finland, men inte har det, kan din vistelse i Finland vara illegal.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c12-utan-tillstand/narration/hb-c12-u0234-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 11.354557823129252, "peak": 0.24981689453125, "generation_seconds": 45.87498621316627, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c12-u0235-s001", "text": "Om du är asylsökande har du rätt att vistas i Finland utan visum eller uppehållstillstånd så länge som handläggningen av din asylansökan pågår.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c12-utan-tillstand/narration/hb-c12-u0235-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 12.538775510204081, "peak": 0.25482177734375, "generation_seconds": 42.75420076888986, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c12-u0236-s001", "text": "Även om du skulle ha kommit lagligt till Finland kan din vistelse i landet senare bli olaglig.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c12-utan-tillstand/narration/hb-c12-u0236-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 8.080544217687075, "peak": 0.267852783203125, "generation_seconds": 28.546675567049533, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c12-u0236-s002", "text": "Detta kan hända till exempel i följande situationer:", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c12-utan-tillstand/narration/hb-c12-u0236-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 5.015510204081632, "peak": 0.337249755859375, "generation_seconds": 17.523301566950977, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c12-u0237-s001", "text": "du får ett negativt beslut på din ansökan om uppehållstillstånd eller asylansökan", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c12-utan-tillstand/narration/hb-c12-u0237-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 7.244625850340136, "peak": 0.3057861328125, "generation_seconds": 20.982579303905368, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c12-u0239-s001", "text": "ditt uppehållstillstånd går ut och du ansöker inte om fortsatt tillstånd i tid eller", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c12-utan-tillstand/narration/hb-c12-u0239-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 7.592925170068027, "peak": 0.28387451171875, "generation_seconds": 23.589605396147817, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c12-u0240-s001", "text": "du har rest in i landet med visum och ditt visum går ut eller", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c12-utan-tillstand/narration/hb-c12-u0240-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 5.572789115646258, "peak": 0.259552001953125, "generation_seconds": 21.108296938007697, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c12-u0241-s001", "text": "vistelsetiden utan visum har gått ut eller du inte längre har någon laglig grund för vistelsen.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c12-utan-tillstand/narration/hb-c12-u0241-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 8.219863945578231, "peak": 0.31475830078125, "generation_seconds": 33.212343256920576, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c12-u0242-s001", "text": "Du har rätt till nödinkvartering och mathjälp om du inte har pengar till mat eller någonstans att övernatta.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c12-utan-tillstand/narration/hb-c12-u0242-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 8.916462585034013, "peak": 0.345062255859375, "generation_seconds": 30.919024943141267, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c12-u0242-s002", "text": "Kommuner, församlingar och vissa organisationer ordnar nödinkvartering.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c12-utan-tillstand/narration/hb-c12-u0242-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 6.548027210884354, "peak": 0.245330810546875, "generation_seconds": 20.068356776144356, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c12-u0243-s001", "text": "Du kan få juridisk rådgivning i frågor kring papperslöshet av en jurist vid Flyktingrådgivningen (Pakolaisneuvonta).", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c12-utan-tillstand/narration/hb-c12-u0243-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 10.24, "peak": 0.311126708984375, "generation_seconds": 33.55893710302189, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c12-u0243-s002", "text": "Rådgivningen är kostnadsfri.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c12-utan-tillstand/narration/hb-c12-u0243-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 2.9257142857142857, "peak": 0.291656494140625, "generation_seconds": 10.650595535058528, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c12-u0244-s001", "text": "Om du blir sjuk eller skadas, har du rätt till brådskande och nödvändig vård inom den offentliga hälso- och sjukvården, till exempel på en hälsostation eller ett sjukhus.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c12-utan-tillstand/narration/hb-c12-u0244-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 14.837551020408164, "peak": 0.3170166015625, "generation_seconds": 48.76601117197424, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c12-u0245-s001", "text": "Offentliga hälsovårdstjänster ordnas av välfärdsområdena (hyvinvointialueet) runtom i Finland.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c12-utan-tillstand/narration/hb-c12-u0245-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 8.568163265306122, "peak": 0.27740478515625, "generation_seconds": 24.455874690087512, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c12-u0245-s002", "text": "Om du behöver hälso- och sjukvårdstjänster ska du kontakta den närmaste social- och hälsocentralen (sosiaali- ja terveyskeskus) på din hemort.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c12-utan-tillstand/narration/hb-c12-u0245-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 12.538775510204081, "peak": 0.326385498046875, "generation_seconds": 38.20941137406044, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
